# NOTE: Builds/VisualStudio2026 and JuceLibraryCode ARE committed (not ignored).
# Headless `Projucer --resave` does not reliably regenerate plugin identity
# fields (company/manufacturer/plugin codes, bundle ID) in this JUCE 9.0.0
# build - confirmed by testing: --set-version and --resave both fail/no-op
# on this project's dual-exporter (XCODE_MAC + VS2026) module path setup.
# The generated project files here have been hand-verified and patched with
# the correct DR-VoxSplit identity (see 'DR-VoxSplit.jucer for the intended
# source of truth). Regenerating via Projucer will require re-applying that
# patch - see .github/workflows/release.yml for the same fix applied to the
# macOS build.

# Build output only (not the generated project files themselves)
Builds/VisualStudio2026/Win32/
Builds/VisualStudio2026/x64/
Builds/MacOSX/build/

# Installer build output
dist/
installer/windows/payload/
installer/macos/payload/

# Stray build artifacts
*.obj
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.lib
.vs/
